#: wiibackup_manager/window.py:526
msgid "Preparar unidad"
msgstr "Prepare drive"

#: wiibackup_manager/window.py:528
msgid ""
"Formatea un USB o SD como FAT32 (32 KB por clúster) y arma la estructura de "
"carpetas que esperan USB Loader GX y Nintendont: apps, games y wbfs. Solo se "
"muestran discos que el sistema marca como removibles -nunca un disco interno."
msgstr ""
"Formats a USB drive or SD card as FAT32 (32 KB per cluster) and creates the "
"folder structure that USB Loader GX and Nintendont expect: apps, games and "
"wbfs. Only disks the system marks as removable are shown -never an internal "
"disk."

